# AGENT.md — src/application/

Orchestrates domain objects. Depends on `domain/` only.

## What lives here

- `dto/<module>/` — input shapes and validation schemas.
- `use-cases/<module>/` — one class per operation. Each use-case receives its
  repository through the constructor (ported from `domain/`).

## Rules

- **May import from `domain/`. May NOT import from `infrastructure/`.**
- **No Express imports.** No `Request`, `Response`, `NextFunction`.
- Use-cases receive repository interfaces (from `domain/`) at construction
  time. They never decide which implementation to use.
- Use-case tests go next to the use-case so they are easy to find.
